<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Anixter International cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Anixter International cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities downgraded Anixter International Inc to a hold from a buy on Tuesday, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 1/4 to 17-5/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
<p>-- The downgrade was based on the valuation of the shares, according to the analyst's office, which confirmed the move.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
